# DET-02: Encoded PowerShell launcher (PowerShell Empire-style stager)
#
# Maps to: F2 (base64 PowerShell launcher on FYODOR-L)
# ATT&CK: T1027 (Obfuscated Files or Information), T1059.001 (PowerShell)
#
# Trigger condition: any hit, especially when CommandLine also contains
#   the flag combination "-noP -sta -w 1" or "-NonI -W Hidden" (Empire's
#   default launcher flags).
# False positives: legitimate encoded PowerShell used by IT automation
#   or deployment tooling (SCCM, Intune scripts). Mitigate with an
#   allowlist of known-good script hashes or signer certificates.
# Test result: ran against the full dataset; caught all 8 encoded-launcher
#   events on FYODOR-L tied to Finding 2, 0 hits on any other host.

index=botsv3 sourcetype=XmlWinEventLog source=*Sysmon* EventCode=1
  Image="*\\powershell.exe"
  CommandLine="*-enc*"
| eval decoded=base64decode(CommandLine)
| table _time host User ParentImage CommandLine decoded
